## SECURITY: never commit signing material.
## The Ed25519 private key belongs in the NETSPARKLE_PRIVATE_KEY Actions secret and nowhere else.
## The PUBLIC key is compiled into the app as a constant and IS committed - that is the point.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
NetSparkle_Ed25519.priv
*_private.key
*.privkey

